\title{bourse: Grounded Market-Data Connector for the ORCHESTRA Framework}
\description{
Fetches historical and live market data (cryptocurrency OHLCV and related series) from public exchange APIs and emits it as a contract-typed, provenance-labelled series for the ORCHESTRA analytics framework. Every external fact -- a symbol, a price tick size, a fee schedule, a column unit -- is recorded in a provenance registry and treated as unverified until it has been diffed against the exchange's own catalogue (the Independent Oracle Principle); an ungrounded fact triggers refusal rather than a silently wrong number.
}
